    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed60561d42195cde6fe0aaff",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是——正因为细心照料并耐心等待——\n花开时的喜悦，才会变得更加巨大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6313f1ca15809a11231d60a7360804d965c02e0631749a12989c797600cdd4c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
