    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c6ae0f0401a87d3f92fda84",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且——想象着收下花的人脸上的笑容。\n这也是……等待时间里的一种乐趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5add4f7decbaaf5515a060d6af3c1ac9f213bfcc5c88b99290c77459d9ed710",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0df7fc37b822abcec9c48e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果不介意的话……需要我帮忙照料花朵吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "be710649f43abcf96c93254022665c7fe9258ddea34dc2210981d13062488767",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
