    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d46de6fa11a725c8703775dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在培育花朵的过程中，她大概已经习惯了等待吧。\n话虽如此，要长时间持续地照料，难道不会很辛苦吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a6f86a34a14b5b4e06fe3e4226bdc46a42b4c664cc4658ce358ac5bfdd360c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1134/storytimeline_041134005.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ceb9fe59489a0e35abbd767",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然我是个外行，也想能帮上点什么忙",
      "source_fingerprint": "52830c8e690086d2fec36708534ee2fb6ab7153be3993bdc78bddc9f0ec78c23",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
