    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1849bdba7cfe73497e3b956",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……如果太过纠缠地要求帮忙，反而会给她添麻烦吧。\n之后，我又看了一会儿花，便回去工作了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1ebab56b69609c75bf3a375b8dc4237116ed99d09f12d2a6ec73dfb1aa62f9b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
