      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "几天后……突然想去看看花，\n便再次来到了花田。结果——",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee8f270615c1766bc240332a1bb472d4be4208244851f679984c925f1fedc54d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
