      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独自一人照料着花朵的机伶金花。\n即使只能在一旁默默守护，作为她的训练员——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ba778dc21605aec0447b6547aa0a2c4497e6c51e2bd308cb27e1dd6f4d43d1a",
