    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9338292b3539500edc2a6386",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如此想着，今天我前往了邻镇一座花卉品种丰富的植物园。\n当我到达最近的公交站时，却发现那里——",
      "source_fingerprint": "9709cac462da290d8f177edcc259d600831481383756705707ab3245e4f8f09a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
